  "game_version": "23661872",
  "author": "LosPenetratus",
  "description": "To give the game more of a realistic view, i decided to adjust the ingame prices of the units to the production cost of the real units and also adjustet the production time. But! I tried to balance everything out, so that you can even defeat the dominant factions with minor ones (like italy or france).\n\nThe \"Renzan\" Bomber resembles now the Ki-21 Bomber (available at 1939) and the Stug 3 is now an tank for germany in 1939.\nAlso, Artillery is now more expensive and slower to produe, to prevent artillery spam.",
